From 0714acf0c6b0c465c0ac31ecb568979c87d278bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bob <robertramsay78@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:46:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Sprite bank of 128 and the Animate page in ADAM Lite too

spr_bank_size() is 128 in every edition (the locked Pro row is gone) and
anim_can_edit() no longer asks pro_gate, so Lite users can fill the whole
bank and animate their actors. Help, tutorial and CLAUDE.md text updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BQFSzGarhTTpK2DHf8XzFr
